    "heading": "Level 3: Paladin Subclass",
    "lineStart": 3448,
    "lineEnd": 3450
  },
  "section": "3.174",
  "rulesText": "You gain a Paladin subclass of your choice. The Oath of Devotion subclass is detailed after this class's description. A subclass is a specialization that grants you features at certain Paladin levels. For the rest of your career, you gain each of your subclass's features that are of your Paladin level or lower."
}
